# Polyglot multi-repo — cross-language API contract drift (Java vs TS)
#
# Fixture: eval/fixtures/multirepo-polyglot. server-java Routes declares
# 5 routes; client-ts API_ROUTES mirrors only 4 (missing
# /v1/admin/reindex) and drifts on /v1/search method (server POST vs
# client GET). The question asks for the drift; the answer must catch
# BOTH the missing route and the method mismatch — a one-sided answer
# (only enumerating one repo) fails.
ID="mr_poly_api_contract"
NAME="polyglot API contract — java route table vs ts client mirror drift"
QUESTION="对比 server-java 的 Routes 路由表与 client-ts 的 API_ROUTES 镜像:哪些路由两边不一致?请逐条指出缺失或漂移的地方,并引用两边的具体定义位置。"
MULTIREPO="multirepo-polyglot"
CAP="5"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="/v1/admin/reindex
/v1/search.*(POST|GET)|(POST|GET).*/v1/search
Routes\.java
routes\.ts"
